<title>ITALY: Italian M2 rose avge 4.3 pct in qtr end-July.</title>
<headline>Italian M2 rose avge 4.3 pct in qtr end-July.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian money supply as measured by M2 rose an adjusted average 4.3 percent year-on-year in the three months to end-July compared with an average growth of 3.6 percent in the three months to end-June, the Bank of Italy said in a statement. -- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
